                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "774d1ab5-fd33-3847-be90-58539f6ef00f",
                        "entry_id": "f44d3aa8-74e9-37ac-bb17-fe6b0f928783",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To catch up with, intercept, or encounter another person by taking a short-cut."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a242468b-874d-4a23-a18e-00e93fe9c353",
                                "sense_id": "774d1ab5-fd33-3847-be90-58539f6ef00f",
                                "text": "These came forth later than the rest but, coasting thwart a hill, They did gaincope him as he came and held their master still Until that all the rest came in and fastened on him too."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "670bdca5-7881-422e-a26c-ac1ff735163f",
                                "sense_id": "774d1ab5-fd33-3847-be90-58539f6ef00f",
                                "text": "[…] and to a companie of my malcontent companions will discouer if it please them, how to be gainfull and gain-coping nauigators if they will insist in my directions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a0e7aca-bd67-4e72-804e-b7fa795615ec",
                                "sense_id": "774d1ab5-fd33-3847-be90-58539f6ef00f",
                                "text": "And sooth to say, I thinke euery man to bee of my minde, that when they see a fellow leape from the subiect he is handling, to disswade them by stale arguments from the thing they already detest, they should skip it ouer, and neuer reade it, gainecope him at the next turning point to his text."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0e763bf7-9f97-4b1b-b604-7882c94db1fe",
                                "sense_id": "774d1ab5-fd33-3847-be90-58539f6ef00f",
                                "text": "Some indeed there have been, of a more heroical strain, who striving to gaincope these ambages, by venturing on a new discovery, have made their voyage in half the time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cb1f087-f1f4-45a1-9770-61ed078c4603",
                                "sense_id": "774d1ab5-fd33-3847-be90-58539f6ef00f",
                                "text": "[…] as he was upon his Flight across a steep Bottom, Gratus gain-coped him, […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
